>MbhC
yas tu me daivavihito bhakṣaḥ kṣatriyapuṃgava | tam utsṛja mahīpāla kapotam imam eva me || 18
>MbhS
yas tu me daivavihito bhakṣaḥ kṣatriyapuṅgava | tam utsṛja mahārāja kapotam imam eva me || 18 ||
>VpŚ2
mamaiva vihito dhātrā bhakṣyo 'yaṃ tvaṃ samut_sṛja |
>VpŚ
mamaiva vihito dhātrā bhakṣo yaṃ taṃ samut__sṛja |
>VpBh
mamaiṣa vihito dhātrā bhakṣo 'yaṃ taṃ samutsṛja | svaṃ rakṣam ātmano dharmaṃ kṣudhitasya kapotakam || 11 ||
>VpBh-A
mamaiva vihito dhātrā bhakṣo 'yaṃ taṃ samutsṛja | rakṣaṃtam ātmano dharmaṃ kṣudhitasya kapotakam || 11 ||
>VpBh-B
mamaiṣa vihito dhātrā bhakṣo 'yaṃ taṃ samutsṛja | svaṃ rakṣam ātmano dharmaṃ kṣudhitasya kapotakam || 11 ||
